      "writtenOn": "2022-10-11T15:55:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What \"customer\" needs this and how will it affect everyone else?  What is the workload here that causes this problem, and what codepath causes it?  Is it an in-kernel driver, or an external driver that can be redone to change the long spintime to be something else?\n\nAnd why use a rwsem at all?  They are notoriously bad and should almost never be used.  Why not use rcu or just a normal spinlock?",
      "parentUuid": "9ca44cf9_100f104b",
      "revId": "65cd2d065e10e425240cbee038ab521fb4286938",
